{"job_id":"F-53630e20bf1c9c67c457","family_id":"F-53630e20bf1c9c67c457","title":"헌법재판소 참고인 등 비용지급에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":23,"target_id":"82e6806cc495668de976a5dcbe3107b516f73550b93671ad40de81943ba35a50","source_hash":"55a937071ae4a14f59a89a33fec92b19d1320c3afc3cb31dab1e71297cae1b6f","text":"宪法法院关于支付参考人员等费用的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":100,"target_id":"7391922e1a7fd11a48d80a3527ed643c2bc630ddfaa1b694403b2e7d040b5443","source_hash":"33e9bcf3b4b2cead2c587fdc7d9cc724d4648e08ebc86cf732dfb4c0070e769c","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是为根据《宪法法院法》第三十条第二款等规定参与裁决程序并作证等的人员，制定支付费用的标准。<2026年4月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":100,"end":339,"target_id":"fe703e12a78a63bd935dd5da859d53455d9494181eaabe5f170d9251ef051378","source_hash":"a2a834ea363169fc5823f7b4791edcb1ef2d2cf23db89b300bfe47d2918bea0e","text":"第 2 条（差旅费和每日津贴）\n① 差旅费（指根据《公务员差旅费规定》支付的交通费、每日津贴、住宿费和餐费；以下简称“差旅费”）和每日津贴可在预算限额内支付给相关人员等。<2010年7月6日、2019年6月19日、2026年4月30日修订>\n② 参考人等的差旅费支付标准，应当按照《公务员差旅费规定》附件二第1项的规定执行。<1997年11月18日、1999年12月17日、2008年11月13日、2019年6月19日、2026年4月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":339,"end":585,"target_id":"16242e236d549c48b5607a799f75146033cd1a85bc950eda98b39ebb035d13c5","source_hash":"e9727278ede88a14552780caee8421fa89a3be599856e374a9c3628f6450b276","text":"文章 3（研究经费）\n① 참고인이 헌법재판소의 요구에 의하여 전문적 지식에 관한 의견서를 제출하거나 변론에 출석하여 진술을 한 때에는 예산의 범위안에서 연구비를 지급할 수 있다. <개정 2019.6.19, 2026.4.30>\n② 헌법연구관이 실시하는 조사기일에 출석할 것을 요구받은 전문의견인이 조사기일에 출석하여 진술을 하거나 전문적 지식에 관한 의견서를 제출한 때에는 예산의 범위안에서 연구비를 지급할 수 있다. <신설 2026.4.30>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":585,"end":605,"target_id":"87e4186a56b59853b33dfdd7623b661928117f02e406572bc467e3da62081a66","source_hash":"1fdaf4591c2d5f5087b3426e0d279e0a07f48d5e987adda2ce9c171afaad4416","text":"文章 4 已删除 <2019.6.19>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":605,"end":680,"target_id":"5d9a889b0461572e76fc8285956781e592b750e422168c60bbf17d15e7a0c3a3","source_hash":"340c19492be1b1e1f27cc8651e16241a43b803d6e957482537de2587820d275e","text":"第五条（每日津贴和研究费用的支付标准） 专家等人员的每日津贴和研究费用的支付标准，由法官会议决议确定。<2026年4月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":680,"end":734,"target_id":"76394c40eda6b1cfd7f420e1606ed626671c7ce906d03ecb25c52bc82c13a081","source_hash":"1166a17fbe4cfa5196523db43fcd995160e66a74322ae93b231a297c19b817ec","text":"第六条（适用规定）本规则未规定的事项，适用宪法法院关于支付证人费用等的规则。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":734,"end":776,"target_id":"f9a058b2e691786085e8e7cc4e503bf5ee2a7c35ff47b46afb7687b9c904f94d","source_hash":"9aff7e73955b72bc37f69b58e5fe5bd6eae6bab331a61d6aa48d97fcd0678e9a","text":"补充规定 <第33号，1991年2月11日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":776,"end":818,"target_id":"1c1d6871283caf1383d66ebe758dfd86665842734d3a36150da6220f22161c84","source_hash":"94f237a20dfa0783006ab5e47b32c3d70b5ba7d072fe9a71fc7f76fb02e4aeec","text":"补充规定 <第61号，1994年8月13日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":818,"end":861,"target_id":"cbfd364ad0789a6d8c6cf4688a95bc2be8417995ad0829678d5905d541068823","source_hash":"aaa113830eaef5038c1f21852c86250be7cf678ff47b7b04d9c620898dd9f794","text":"补充规定 <第93号，1997年11月18日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":861,"end":905,"target_id":"8f8f45df149eb9b880f84328c17b0ef5da36a03e1e7b51b3e3f5ca0389b085ca","source_hash":"e022ad170a0984db4164490cf4595eb62e9894ed4c247352c6c1918f61065790","text":"补充规定 <第110号，1999年12月17日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":905,"end":949,"target_id":"c7129a6bdf4aa720dc76bce7ffdd771713330ca2d4def2d763708541e1b21097","source_hash":"bd2cb6d1056824eea15a5ca7825c48106dc6887017ce6a6f68154af78863d0b5","text":"补充规定 <第228号，2008年11月13日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":949,"end":987,"target_id":"7b59c62006012efe115f238fcba5f58ee54f9ebfa617dd3952e6283a13dc38b3","source_hash":"1f339ef69945c14af4cafb5560598601afa46a9d3fd4f1d176a80d2b3b362a72","text":"补充规定（宪法法院证据审查费用规则）<第256号，2010年7月6日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":987,"end":1017,"target_id":"06844901bf8684305189b5e5846b6f55150150a6163417b9394f0043e0892e29","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1017,"end":1143,"target_id":"0c7d86188f9f61a564516900f56aa3e85fc89fb0a398e7808a9628007cdd0e22","source_hash":"7ee08cc0cb75a04754493b4c8e0a1cdb1ead01c1574a2ec2e5870b459a759678","text":"第二条（其他规则的修改）① 省略\n\n  ② 对《宪法法院参考人员费用支付规则》的部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第2条第1款中的“差旅费”一词应改为“差旅费（指根据《公务员差旅费条例》支付的旅费和每日津贴。下文同上）”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1143,"end":1186,"target_id":"0ea80c4f2d4b8edde0aaf5157988738eff66d35b9a3b5d101c88e998f72029af","source_hash":"19606ea769aaaa7279caec2563907cf367a3271de2c6b33ea80724f1fb5f64e6","text":"补充规定 <第411号，2019年6月19日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006104-285845-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1186,"end":1227,"target_id":"a9c83c2070951ec59e53d9e9b24cac22ea1b1320e30320cdd633326065b9b67c","source_hash":"356fa8f9b5e3277bfdf12e9275d38bef7362ea1d605aebfb593d7783683300a5","text":"补充规定 <第495号，2026年4月30日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。"}]}